{
  "recording_id": "lrcapi:1444719877",
  "source": "LrcAPI https://api.lrc.cx/jsonapi?title=%E8%80%81%E6%83%85%E6%AD%8C&artist=%E6%B1%9F%E8%95%99&album=%E7%88%B1%E4%BD%9C%E6%A2%A6%E7%9A%84%E9%B1%BC#1444719877",
  "lines": [
    {
      "time": 20.06,
      "text": "原來你也擱留著 咱蓋的彼領被",
      "kind": "lyric"
    },
    {
      "time": 29.49,
      "text": "原來你彼呢驚 我甲你講再會",
      "kind": "lyric"
    },
    {
      "time": 38.89,
      "text": "原來你也擱置恨悔 你講的彼句話",
      "kind": "lyric"
    },
    {
      "time": 47.53,
      "text": "原來你一生中 只愛過我一個",
      "kind": "lyric"
    },
    {
      "time": 56.46,
      "text": "猶原塊落雨",
      "kind": "lyric"
    },
    {
      "time": 59.3,
      "text": "猶原你的眼神彼無辜 親像當初",
      "kind": "lyric"
    },
    {
      "time": 65.87,
      "text": "可惜阮的心 袂擱行同路",
      "kind": "lyric"
    },
    {
      "time": 70.58,
      "text": "袂擱濕糊糊",
      "kind": "lyric"
    },
    {
      "time": 73.91,
      "text": "你也免恨悔 往事會變成一蕊花",
      "kind": "lyric"
    },
    {
      "time": 79.28,
      "text": "陪咱渡過思念的溪",
      "kind": "lyric"
    },
    {
      "time": 85.5,
      "text": "彼美麗 精彩的經過",
      "kind": "lyric"
    },
    {
      "time": 88.55,
      "text": "挺好茫旋歸暝 一杯擱一杯",
      "kind": "lyric"
    },
    {
      "time": 93.94,
      "text": "傷心話 只有加添怨磋",
      "kind": "lyric"
    },
    {
      "time": 98.45,
      "text": "今夜咱來講笑虧",
      "kind": "lyric"
    },
    {
      "time": 103.27,
      "text": "點一條老情歌",
      "kind": "lyric"
    },
    {
      "time": 106.07,
      "text": "再會吧無緣戀花",
      "kind": "lyric"
    },
    {
